5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to be decisive this year. I suggest we look into the logistics and the social dynamics of our previous trips to avoid past mistakes.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. It would be lovely to ensure the financial side is handled fairly for everyone this time around.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the bathrooms and when we have to eat. I don't like being rushed.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the travel time. I would like to see how much of our week is spent in transit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm with Shizue. I'd like to know the total costs upfront so there are no surprises at the end of the trip.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if you check the travel, I can look into how our group dynamics worked last year.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,That sounds sensible. I will look into how the bills were split previously.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, can you help me find out about the room arrangements?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the ferry and train times.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I can do that, Minato. I'll also look into the all-in rates.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll also check the time we spent alone during the shared-house year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look into the pricing of those offshore houses.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll check the bathing hours too.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into the local transport options for the different areas.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think we have covered the main points.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
