30,2,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems last year we were too disconnected, but the shared house was too crowded. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The offshore houses seem affordable per person, but separate bookings last time were very uneven.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The inn has a strict schedule and everyone sleeps in one room. The island house only has one bathroom.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The ferry takes too long, costing us two whole days. The train to the valley is much faster.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The valley inn is a set price, but city hotels are expensive and meals are extra.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if the ferry is that slow, the island might be too draining.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, does the all-in rate at the inn seem fair for everyone?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I don't like the idea of one bathroom for all of us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"The city has the best transport, but the valley is also quite accessible.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"The all-in rate is simple, but it means light eaters pay the same as heavy eaters.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,A city break would allow us to be together but have our own space.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,But would that lead to the uneven costs I found in the separate bookings?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I prefer the city if it means I have my own door and no strict mealtimes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Minato. Minimizing travel and maximizing peace is key.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,I worry the city will be the most expensive and hardest to budget for.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,We can set a budget for the city. It's better than feeling trapped or lost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"As long as we agree on the payment method beforehand, I can support that.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want to be able to sleep and wash in peace.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"The valley is a compromise, but the city is the most efficient.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"If we can manage the costs, the city sounds like it suits most of us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
