60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's review. Option A is the Hot Spring Town, B is the Island, and C is the City Break.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The island house is cheap, but the bathroom situation Minato mentioned is a concern.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,I really don't want the island or the shared room at the inn.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The island is out for me because of the ferry times.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,The Hot Spring Town is the most predictable for my budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, would you be okay with the city if we used a fixed budget?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I think the city is the safest bet for everyone's comfort.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I vote for the city.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I also vote for the city.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm still leaning toward the valley for the cost certainty.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll vote for the city to ensure we have a balance of together-time and alone-time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also vote for the city; it seems the most considerate of Minato's needs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, please consider the city!","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,It's the most logical choice for our time.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,You've convinced me that the others really need the city's layout. I'll join you.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
